WEBVTT

00:11:58.996 --> 00:12:04.287
And I think if artificial intelligence,
even in its current very larval state,

00:12:04.704 --> 00:12:08.246
can make us confront new things
and sort of inspire new ideas,

00:12:08.246 --> 00:12:09.829
that's already pretty impressive.

00:12:10.454 --> 00:12:13.329
Give us a sense of what's actually
happening in the background there.

00:12:13.454 --> 00:12:15.246
I think it's hard to understand

00:12:15.246 --> 00:12:19.662
because you read these words seem like
someone is trying to mean something.

00:12:19.662 --> 00:12:23.746
Obviously, I think you believe that
there's whatever you've built there,

00:12:23.746 --> 00:12:27.537
that there's a sort of thinking, sentient
thing that's going, oh,

00:12:27.537 --> 00:12:32.996
I must answer this question. So so what
how would you describe what's going on?